fixtures/vectors/*.json.gz
  Filtered, subsampled derivatives of the SingleStepTests/680x0 68000 test
  sets (https://github.com/SingleStepTests/680x0, commit e0d5ece9).  That
  repository carries no licence file; it publishes the tests "as an aid to
  reimplementation".  They are used only by the test suite, and their status
  is recorded in fixtures/vectors/UPSTREAM_LICENSE.  If you are the upstream
  author and want them removed or relicensed, please open an issue.

Not included
  Amiga64 does not include, and never uploads anywhere, any Commodore or
  Amiga, Inc. software.  You supply your own Workbench 3.1 disk image (ADF);
  the amiga64 tool copies it only to your own Ultimate's storage, and only
  when you confirm.

